<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Native English@Libda — จองวันเรียน</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--navy:#154a8a;--navy2:#0f3d73;--sky:#5a7b9e;--bg:#f4f8fd;--gold:#f5b400;--line:#dbe7f5}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Sarabun',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#1a2b3c;line-height:1.55}
.wrap{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 48px}
.top{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),#1f6bc0);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:30px 16px 46px}
.top h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.top p{color:#cfe2f7;margin-top:4px;font-size:15px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(21,74,138,.08);margin-bottom:14px}
.card:first-of-type{margin-top:-30px}
h2{font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:800}
.num{width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
.hint{color:#8aa3bd;font-size:13px;margin:3px 0 14px 34px}
.dayhead{font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 7px;padding-left:2px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:9px}
.slots{display:grid;gap:9px;grid-template-columns:1fr}
@media(min-width:560px){.slots{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.slot{border:2px solid #e3ecf7;background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:12px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:.15s}
.slot:hover{border-color:rgba(21,74,138,.4)}
.slot.on{border-color:var(--gold);background:#fffbe9;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(245,180,0,.2)}
.slot .t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.slot .time{font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);font-size:16px}
.slot .sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--sky);margin-top:3px}
.pill{border-radius:20px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;background:#e6f7ec;color:#1b7a42}
.pill.low{background:#fff0e0;color:#b45309}
.grid{display:grid;gap:12px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{display:block}
label>span{display:block;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#3d556e;margin-bottom:5px}
input,select{width:100%;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #c9d8ea;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff;outline:none;transition:.15s}
input:focus,select:focus{border-color:var(--navy);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(21,74,138,.13)}
#phone,#cfgPhone{letter-spacing:1.5px;font-weight:700}
.btn{width:100%;padding:14px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;margin-top:18px;transition:.15s}
.btn:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--navy2)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn.sm{width:auto;padding:9px 20px;font-size:14px;margin-top:14px}
.btn.gray{background:#8096ac}.btn.green{background:#159254}
.msg{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
.msg.ok{background:#e7f7ed;color:#12663a;border:1px solid #b9e6cb}
.msg.err{background:#fdeceb;color:#a52e22;border:1px solid #f5c6c2}
.contact{border:2px dashed rgba(21,74,138,.28);text-align:center}
.contact .lb{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--sky)}
.contact .ph{display:inline-block;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:2px;margin-top:4px;text-decoration:none}
.contact .ph:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.contact .line{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--sky);margin-top:6px}
.foot{text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:#9db1c6;margin-top:18px}
.foot a{color:var(--sky)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th{background:#eef4fb;color:var(--navy);text-align:left;padding:9px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
td{padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf3f9;white-space:nowrap}
.scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.lnk{color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;background:none;border:0;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px}
.lnk.red{color:#c0392b}
.hide{display:none!important}
.demo{background:#fff6dc;border-bottom:1px solid #f0dfa8;color:#7a5c00;font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:8px 14px}
.center{display:flex;min-height:100vh;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}
.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;background:#e6f7ec;color:#1b7a42}
.badge.off{background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="demoBar" class="demo hide">
  โหมดทดลอง (รันแบบ Local ในเครื่อง) — ข้อมูลจะเชื่อมต่อกับ Cloudflare D1 เมื่ออัปขึ้น Cloudflare Pages
</div>

<!-- ══════════ หน้าจอง ══════════ -->
<div id="pageBook">
  <header class="top">
    <h1>Native English@Libda</h1>
    <p>ลงทะเบียนจองวันและเวลาเรียน</p>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="num">1</span>เลือกวันและเวลาเรียน</h2>
      <p class="hint">แตะที่รอบเรียนที่ต้องการ</p>
      <div id="slotArea">กำลังโหลด...</div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
